    "review_requirements": [
      "Read complete question, reference answer, all known positive chunks and full candidate for context, then independently judge the actual retained model input.",
      "Use raw IDs/offsets/special masks plus decoder rendering and source-prefix rendering to inspect actual input and boundary. Decode is an interpretation of tokenizer IDs, not an exact source quote.",
      "Do not import a qualifier, negation, exception, subject or condition from discarded text into the model-visible input.",
      "For negative, explain why retained input fails to support this particular requested fact and whether loss of the ending changes the reason. Mere lack of original positive annotation is insufficient.",
      "If truncation leaves plausible answer support, removes a critical disambiguating qualifier/negation, creates a contradiction affecting relevance, or cannot be semantically resolved, label relevant/ambiguous/unknown as appropriate and block the query.",
